  "notes": "Standalone scholarly Work published in 1994 under the two series identifiers ATU 5 and ADFU 15. The publisher reports Robert K. Englund with a contribution by Rainer M. Boehmer. Nissen 2024 identifies numerical-only tablets omitted from ATU 1 as later published in ATU 5; that is a historically recoverable subset inside this Work, not a second Work and not the distinct ATU 2 numerical-systems analysis. Publisher ca. 820 documents and current CDLI 897 related artifacts remain dated, source-specific coverage observations. No Expression, Edition, Item, payload, exact tablet membership, sign inventory, source text, image, semantics, or redistribution permission is admitted.",
